  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2021/03/ElRacoDeFran-11.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(10 fotos) El Rac&oacute; de Fran ja t&eacute; la terrassa oberta a la Font de Dins d&#39;Onda i ha fet tamb&eacute; reformes a l&#39;interior per quan es puga entrar en un futur. L&#39;horari a l&#39;exterior &eacute;s, de moment, de dilluns a divendres, de 9 a 14h, i disabte i diumenge, de 10 a 17 hores, o abans si no hi ha clientela.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/elracodefran-1.jpg\" alt=\"elracodefran-1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/elracodefran-2.jpg\" alt=\"elracodefran-2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/elracodefran-3.jpg\" alt=\"elracodefran-3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/elracodefran-4.jpg\" alt=\"elracodefran-4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/elracodefran-5.jpg\" alt=\"elracodefran-5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/img_20210302_094149.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210302_094149\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/img_20210302_094204.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210302_094204\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/img_20210302_094217.jpg\" alt=\"img_20210302_094217\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/raco-de-fran/img_20210302_